            0.706
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Imagine a situation where all the organisms that carry out photosynthesis on the earth have disappeared. What would be the impact of this on living organisms?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.265,
            0.708,
            0.883,
            0.784
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. A potato slice shows the presence of starch with iodine solution. Where does the starch in potatoes come from? Where is the food synthesised in the plant, and how does it reach the potato?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.265,
            0.787,
            0.883,
            0.827
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Does the broad and flat structure of leaves make plants more efficient for photosynthesis? Justify your answer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.265,
